  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "神秘的生日快递  (A Mysterious Birthday Delivery)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xiaoye": "小叶",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Moments after Kaiwen leaves, Xiaoye calls Bu Xiaogu over to the reception desk to sign for an unexpected express package. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "小谷，小谷，你先等一下！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "怎么了？有什么事吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "这儿有一份你的快递。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "好浪漫啊，这么可爱的生日礼物！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是寄给我的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "你看，这卡片上写着祝你生日快乐呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "这是谁送的呀？你不是说你是单身吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我确实是单身啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但是这整座城市里，也没有人知道我的生日啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我从来没有跟别人说过我的生日。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "不会吧，那你是不是忘记什么贵宾了？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "小谷，小谷，你先等一下！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, Xiaogu, wait a second!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "怎么了？有什么事吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is it? Is something up?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "这儿有一份你的快递。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is an express package here for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "好浪漫啊，这么可爱的生日礼物！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How romantic—such an adorable birthday gift!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是寄给我的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Was this really sent to me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "你看，这卡片上写着祝你生日快乐呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look, the card right here wishes you a happy birthday.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "这是谁送的呀？你不是说你是单身吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who sent this? Did you not say you were single?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我确实是单身啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I really am single.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但是这整座城市里，也没有人知道我的生日啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet in this entire city, nobody even knows my birthday.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我从来没有跟别人说过我的生日。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have never told anyone when my birthday is.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "不会吧，那你是不是忘记什么贵宾了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No way—could you have forgotten about some special admirer?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "小谷，小谷，你先等一下！",
      "gap": 0.5
